{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"They take the sandwich greatfully and take several very large bites. Still with a mouthful of food they start explaining. \"I had a conversation with Malathor. I'd like to know everything you can tell me about him and what it's like to work with him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:21:14.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102044173172807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"Bo nods. \"Despite what the people believe... He seems like an ok fella ta me. Ain't never led me wrong, andnhe's kept his word. His methods are unorthodox, but you actually learn.\" He smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:23:39.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102652951244811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"And i've met quite the spectacle of creatures... One of my favorites was this really big hippity-hoppity.\" Bo chuckles","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:25:47.137000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T06:26:28.368000Z","id":"869103187838251048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
