{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"Bo continues to eat. \"A'corse... There's quite a bit of oddness about him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:29:49.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869104205456101386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"That big hippity-hoppity? He swallowed me... I was inside him. I think?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:30:19.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869104328173039626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"But he let me out when I delivered a letter to a face in the wall of being inside it. And he loves music, I can tell.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:31:18.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869104576488431616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"Jigsaw looks over Bo's face. \"I... Am not one to give myself over to a leader very easily. I like having my own freedom. He hasn't done anything to... Force your loyalty?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:34:19.006000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869105334772465734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"None what so ever... It's always been by choice.\" He takes another bite. \"In truth, he's a friend, someone i've grown to trust. He has always offered payment for the favors he asks.\" Bo shrugs. \"I just aint normally the type to take payment.\" He chuckles","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:37:43.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869106190712455218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Again, by choice... He aint forced nothing on me that I aint wished for.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:39:10.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869106557374304308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"Jigsaw nods slowly and takes a bite of their sandwich. \"It seems too good to be true but...\" They sigh, \"Perhaps he is the sponsor I need to get my work back to where it once was.\" They pause again before saying, \"Plăsmuitor is the title he gave me, along with supplies and gold in exchange for my work on a project of his. I still don't know exactly what. I'm hoping to find out tonight. But I can't shake the feeling...\" They shake their head. \"I don't know. It's been a long time since I've had any kind of title.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:45:54.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869108252682637342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
