{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"851227479112548382","content":"\"Should I have told you its favorite pastimes so that you could go have tea with it? Don't act like you're so above me in morality here. You guys were the one who asked me to visit Niflhel and check things out. It's not my fault you didn't like what I had to say.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T06:56:20.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870560428357451787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
